OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy in the north and west
OL,6,Ftoday with rain moving into
OL,7,Fnorthwestern areas. Largely dry across
OL,8,Fmuch of England and Wales with some
OL,9,Fvery warm sunshine in the southeast
OL,10,Ftoday.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavy rain slowly moves
OL,13,Facross parts of Northern Ireland and
OL,14,FScotland tonight. Largely dry and
OL,15,Fcloudy in England and Wales with some
OL,16,Fdrizzle in the north and west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
